&lt;h1&gt;


🚀 MyZubster NFT Dashboard – A Complete Frontend for Tari NFTs
&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;p&gt;After building the backend Rust template for Tari NFTs and dockerizing it, I wanted to create a user-friendly interface that anyone could use. The result is &lt;strong&gt;MyZubster NFT Dashboard&lt;/strong&gt; – a complete React frontend for managing NFT collections on Tari.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FDanielIoni-creator%2Ftari-nft-template%2Fmain%2Fmyzubster-dashboard.png" class="article-body-image-wrapper"&gt;&lt;img src="https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width=800%2Cheight=%2Cfit=scale-down%2Cgravity=auto%2Cformat=auto/https%3A%2F%2Fraw.githubusercontent.com%2FDanielIoni-creator%2Ftari-nft-template%2Fmain%2Fmyzubster-dashboard.png" alt="MyZubster NFT Dashboard" width="800" height="400"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;




